; A price written on a posting (@, @@) and a cost ({}) are not rates for convert().
2026-01-01 open Assets:UnitPrice
2026-01-01 open Assets:TotalPrice
2026-01-01 open Assets:Cost
2026-01-01 open Assets:CostAndPrice
2026-01-01 open Assets:PriceAndDirective
2026-01-01 open Assets:Native
2026-01-01 open Equity:Other

; the only price directive is for the last commodity: its own rate, not the 3 EUR of the posting
2026-02-01 price PPP 5 EUR

2026-01-02 * "annotations"
  Assets:UnitPrice        2 UUU @ 100 EUR
  Assets:TotalPrice      -2 TTT @@ 100 EUR
  Assets:Cost             2 CCC {80 EUR}
  Assets:CostAndPrice     2 BBB {80 EUR} @ 100 EUR
  Assets:PriceAndDirective 2 PPP @ 3 EUR
  Assets:Native          10 EUR
  Equity:Other
